@startuml
title Sequence - UC-10 Private Achievements [PROPOSED / NOT IMPLEMENTED]
skinparam shadowing false
actor Learner
participant "Lesson/SRS Flow" as Flow
participant "Achievement Evaluator\n[PROPOSED]" as Eval
database "Learner Progress" as Progress
database "Badge Store\n[PROPOSED]" as Badges

Learner -> Flow: Complete qualifying activity
Flow -> Progress: Commit progress/review event
Progress --> Flow: Success
Flow -> Eval: Evaluate learner event
Eval -> Progress: Read learner-owned counters
Progress --> Eval: Progress snapshot
Eval -> Badges: Check active rules and existing awards
alt new condition met
  Badges -> Badges: Insert award idempotently
  Badges --> Eval: New badge
else already awarded/not met
  Badges --> Eval: No-op
end
Eval --> Flow: Award summary
Flow --> Learner: Show private badge/progress
note over Eval,Badges
  No leaderboard. Data model and mechanism
  require separate approval.
end note
@enduml
